  "content": "[Intro 1]\n[C5]\n[F#dim7]  [D7]\n[Fm]  [Db7]\n[C5]\n[F#dim7]  [D7]\n[Fm]  [Db7]\n\n[Intro 2]\n[C5]\n[Ab5]  [Bb5]\n[C5]\n[Ab5]  [Bb5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C5]All wound up,\non the edge,\nterrified\n[Ab5]  [G5]  [Bb5]\n[C5]Sleep disturbed,\nrestless mind,\npetrified\n[Ab5]  [G5]  [Bb5]\n[C5]Bouts of fear\npermeate\nall I see\n[Ab5]  [G5]  [Bb5]\n[C5]Heightening\nnervousness\nthreatens me\n[Ab5]  [G5]  [Bb5]\n[Eb5]I am\npara-\nlyzed\nSo af-\nraid to\ndie\n[C5]Caught off guard,\nwarning signs\nnever show\n[Ab5]  [G5]  [Bb5]\n[C5]Tension strikes,\nchoking me,\nworries grow\n\n[Break]\n[Bbm]\n[F#]\n[Gdim]\n[Edim7]  [F7]\n[Bbm]\n[F#]\n[Gdim]\n[Edim7]  [F7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Fm]Why do I\n[G#m]feel so\n[C5]numb?\n[Fm]Is it something to\n[G#m]do with where I come\n[C5]from?\n[Fm]Should this be\n[G#m]fight or\n[C5]flight?\n[Fm]I don't know why I'm\n[G#m]constantly so up-\n\n[Main Riff]\n[C5]tight\n[F#dim7]  [D7]\n[Fm]  [Db7]\n\n[Break]\n[C5]\n[Ab5]  [Bb5]\n[C5]\n[Ab5]  [Bb5]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C5]Rapid heartbeat\npounding through my\nchest\n[Eb5]  [Bb5]\n[C5]Agitated\nbody in dis-\ntress\n[Eb5]  [Bb5]\n[C5]I\nfeel like I'm in\ndanger\n[Eb5]  [Bb5]\n[C5]Daily life is\nstrangled by my\nstress\n[Eb5][Bb5]A\n[Eb5]stifling surge\nshooting through all my\nveins\n[Gb5][Db5]Ext-\n[Eb5]reme apprehension,\nsuddenly I'm in-\nsane\n[Gb5]  [Db5]\n[C5]Lost\nall hope for re-\ndemption\n[Eb5][Bb5]A\n[C5]grave situation\ndesperate at\nbest\n\n[Break]\n[Bbm]\n[F#]\n[Gdim]\n[Edim7]  [F7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Fm]Why do I\n[G#m]feel so\n[C5]numb?\n[Fm]Is it something to\n[G#m]do with where I come\n[C5]from?\n[Fm]Should this be\n[G#m]fight or\n[C5]flight?\n[Fm]I don't know why I'm\n[G#m]constantly reeling\n\n[Bridge]\n[Cm]Help-\n[Fm/C]less [Ddim/C]hys-\n[Cm]teri-\n[Fm/C]a [G]A\n[Cm]false\n[Bdim]sense [G]of\n[Eb]urgency\n[Dm7b5]  [F#dim7]  [G7]\n[Cm]Trapped\n[Fm/C]in [Ddim/C]my\n[Cm]phobi-\n[Fm/C]a [G]Pos-\n[Cm]sessed\n[Bdim]by [G]an-\n[Eb]xiety\n[Dm7b5]  [F#dim7]  [G7]\n[Ab]Run, try to\n[Cm]hide Over-\n[Fm]whelmed by this\n[F#dim7]complex [G7]deliri-\n\n[Main Riff]\n[C5]um\n\n[Break]\n[F5]\n[Db5]  [C5]\n[F5]\n[Db5]  [C5]\n\n[Keyboard Solo]\n[Bb5]\n[Gb5]  [F5]\n[Bb5]\n[Gb5]  [F5]\n[Eb5]\n[B5]  [Bb5]\n[Eb5]\n[B5]  [Bb5]\n\n[Guitar Solo]\n[Ab5]\n[E5]  [Eb5]\n[Ab5]\n[E5]  [Eb5]\n[Db5]\n[A5]  [Ab5]\n[Db5]\n[A5]  [Ab5]\n\n[Break]\n[Bbm]\n[F#]\n[Gdim]\n[Edim7]  [F7]\n[Bbm]\n[F#]\n[Gdim]\n[Edim7]  [F7]\n[Fm]\n[Db]\n[Ddim]\n[Bdim7]  [C7]\n[Fm]\n[Db]\n[Ddim]\n[Bdim7]  [C7]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Cm]Help-\n[Fm/C]less [Ddim/C]hys-\n[Cm]teri-\n[Fm/C]a [G]A\n[Cm]false\n[Bdim]sense [G]of\n[Eb]urgency\n[Dm7b5]  [F#dim7]  [G7]\n[Cm]Trapped\n[Fm/C]in [Ddim/C]my\n[Cm]phobi-\n[Fm/C]a [G]Pos-\n[Cm]sessed\n[Bdim]by [G]an-\n[Eb]xiety\n[Dm7b5]  [F#dim7]  [G7]\n[Ab]Run, try to\n[Cm]hide Over-\n[Fm]whelmed by this\n[F#dim7]complex [G7]deliri-\n\n[Outro]\n[C5]um\n[F#dim7]  [D7]\n[Fm]  [Db7]\n[C5]\n[F#dim7]  [D7]\n[F#dim7]  [G7]\n[Cm]",
